Modding Research

I researched how Minecraft mods are built and learned:

Most modern mods use NeoForge
Mods are written in Java
Blocks, items, and tabs must be registered using Deferred Registers
Mods follow a lifecycle (common setup, client setup, server events)
Assets like textures and recipes are handled using JSON files

